      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:rain_chime",
      "text": [
        "Turns the weather into a redstone signal. The Rain Chime needs no Pulse and no fuel, and it does not make Pulse either. It just tells you what the sky is doing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading it",
      "text": [
        "Put a comparator against it: **8** in rain, **15** in a thunderstorm, **0** under clear skies. Weather is world-wide, so a roof does not mute it.",
        "It also chimes softly every **ten seconds** while it rains.",
        "A redstone signal into the chime mutes it and sets its output to 0."
      ]
    },
